# Detach the attached board, /scene/detach_board (decision-log 5n, S-3 / S-6).
# keep_as_obstacle true: the board stays as a fixed obstacle with exactly its attached shape and pose
# (incl. the contact margin at its bottom), named stack_<n> -> the stack grows. false: removed.
bool keep_as_obstacle
---
bool success              # false: no board attached, MoveIt not reachable
string message
string name               # kept obstacle name "stack_<n>"; "" if removed
